  "project_description": "Redirection payment for Drupal Commerce and DIAS (Greece).\n\nDIAS serves as the Greek hub of credit transfers and direct debits.\n\n By using redirection payments your site's customers get redirected to the bank and fill in their credit card data there. Credit card information is NOT stored in Drupal's database. This ensures better security and it costs less because there is no need for expensive compliance certificates on your server.",
